  "assessment": "The United States remains stable with robust democratic institutions, strong alliances, and a solid economy, though budget deficits require disciplined fiscal management. Intelligence highlights ongoing strategic competition and potential threats from adversaries like Russia, Iran, and North Korea, necessitating steadfast support for our allies and maintenance of our global deterrent posture. We will accept South Korea's alliance proposal, Taiwan's trade deal, and provide requested aid to Ukraine while reaffirming our core security commitments through private diplomatic channels.",
